{"name": "r1102b-A1", "sha256": "4a0feb1353ccc25d15842230183af05438ec1c6996d5961bec3a0fd9dd96a989", "words": 191, "headline": "Human Written", "prediction_short": "Human", "fraction_ai": 7.68289102784283e-34, "fraction_ai_assisted": 0.0, "fraction_human": 1.0, "version": "4.1", "source": "new", "dashboard_link": "https://www.pangram.com/history/5ad82ada-83a8-4c4f-89f2-4f0966465f5f", "utc": "2026-11-02T17:17:05Z", "windows": [["Human Written", "High", 198, 0, 1033, "Your inner child won’t trust you right away. It’s not going to be enough for you to meditate, say three nice sentences to the inner child and expect to have its trust. What’s going to help your inner child to trust you is you, the person you are right now, becoming reliable.\nHere I’m going to talk about what you develop in yourself as you reparent your inner child. I’m going to talk about it in terms of three jobs: your loving Nurturer, your safe Adult Protector (hereafter just the Protector) and your wise Guide. That’s one grown-up doing three jobs, not three more people moving in to help with the rent, and each job keeps the others in balance. Say a party gets to be too much for your little one. The Protector gets you both out of there, and on the way home the Nurturer tells them they did great, even though mostly they hid in the bathroom. And the Guide helps them think twice about the next weird party they might go to, avoiding another cycle of bathroom vacationing. 🙈 It’s you that needs to develop these qualities."]]}
{"name": "r1102b-B0", "sha256": "567e14afacb478d4d0daf8330e4b19040dc31039e43eee3976ddf26277cee23f", "words": 354, "headline": "AI Detected", "prediction_short": "Mixed", "fraction_ai": 0.25990813970565796, "fraction_ai_assisted": 5.3040553632311684e-27, "fraction_human": 0.740091860294342, "version": "4.1", "source": "new", "dashboard_link": "https://www.pangram.com/history/1087d1e2-6e20-41b5-8b2e-81d64be3b2cf", "utc": "2026-11-02T17:17:12Z", "windows": [["Human Written", "Low", 21, 0, 112, "Once you’ve got your bearings, make your first wish.\n\"Please show me the next truth. The next symbol or feeling."], ["Human Written", "Medium", 39, 112, 304, " The question or action that's useful for me at this time, and no more than I can handle.\"\nStay awake when your mind likes to escape\nIf your mind keeps drifting off, sit up and open your eyes."], ["Human Written", "High", 17, 304, 386, " Then feel your feet on the floor, and just let your breathing go at its own pace."], ["Human Written", "Low", 7, 386, 426, " Tell yourself, \"I'm not going anywhere."], ["Human Written", "Medium", 9, 426, 477, " I'm happily arriving more fully here each moment.\""], ["Human Written", "High", 32, 477, 643, "\nPick something in the room to look at, and feel your spine at the same time (focusing on two things makes it harder for the mind to use multitasking mode to wander)."], ["Human Written", "Medium", 15, 643, 729, " Then ask yourself what the daydreaming is doing for you. Is it bringing you guidance?"], ["Human Written", "High", 87, 729, 1208, " Does it help you work through a feeling, or are you using it to avoid something?\nAsk for any diffuse benefits to become more practically focused: \"If this is guidance, show me what I need to do about it. If I'm avoiding something, bring me gently back to the present and show me what it is.\"\nMake the hypnosis more alert\nAside from focusing on things in your direct experience, you can also suggest yourself into greater alertness (it's still relaxed-alert, not paranoid-alert)."], ["Human Written", "Medium", 4, 1208, 1229, " Keep your eyes open."], ["Human Written", "High", 18, 1229, 1334, " Use a small hand movement each time you make the auto-suggestion that you're gaining increasing clarity."], ["Human Written", "Medium", 12, 1334, 1393, " Then stop the hand movement and see where your mind is at."], ["Human Written", "Low", 12, 1393, 1455, " That hand movement is the mental escape into the body's flow."], ["AI-Generated", "Low", 18, 1455, 1563, " Say something like,\n“Starting with your eyes open, press your thumb to your forefinger, gently, and let go."], ["AI-Generated", "Low", 24, 1563, 1687, " As you do, you begin to bring yourself into a place of clearer awareness… Press and let go again, and you’re clearer still."], ["AI-Generated", "Low", 10, 1687, 1744, " And once more, into the clearest state of awareness yet."], ["AI-Generated", "Low", 3, 1744, 1763, " Now stop pressing."], ["AI-Generated", "Low", 39, 1763, 1972, " In the first second after you stop, notice if there’s any echo of the pressing in your fingers, in your breathing, in your attention, or nowhere at all. Just notice, sit up straight and work from this level.”"]]}
{"name": "r1102b-B3", "sha256": "b818312e161819378fb0b4fe3aa9a328ad70d5f8a308938046763f12ac6f8002", "words": 168, "headline": "AI Detected", "prediction_short": "Mixed", "fraction_ai": 0.2532274127006531, "fraction_ai_assisted": 5.282950742731692e-22, "fraction_human": 0.7467725872993469, "version": "4.1", "source": "new", "dashboard_link": "https://www.pangram.com/history/c6990553-fb90-4cc5-ae42-42fd1e0caa26", "utc": "2026-11-02T17:17:16Z", "windows": [["Human Written", "High", 89, 0, 512, "Aside from focusing on things in your direct experience, you can also suggest yourself into greater alertness (it's still relaxed-alert, not paranoid-alert). Keep your eyes open. Use a small hand movement each time you make the auto-suggestion that you're gaining increasing clarity. Then stop the hand movement and see where your mind is at. That hand movement is the mental escape into the body's flow. Say something like,\n“Starting with your eyes open, press your thumb to your forefinger, gently, and let go."], ["Human Written", "Medium", 18, 512, 598, " Each time you do, you get a little more awake… Press and let go again, a bit clearer."], ["Human Written", "Low", 12, 598, 659, " And once more, and now you’re clearer than when you started."], ["Human Written", "Low", 3, 659, 678, " Now stop pressing."], ["AI-Generated", "Low", 15, 678, 762, " In the first second after you stop, see if the pressing is still echoing somewhere."], ["AI-Generated", "High", 21, 762, 882, " Maybe your fingers still tingle, or your breath is keeping the rhythm, or your attention is waiting for the next press."], ["AI-Generated", "Low", 8, 882, 915, " Or maybe there’s no echo at all."], ["Human Written", "Low", 10, 915, 971, " Just notice, sit up straight and work from this level.”"]]}
{"name": "r1102b-C1", "sha256": "88195c843200e0b6138e2db454ceab30bc6dcb11f0c276f63f7a7eb4d476cb6e", "words": 197, "headline": "Human Written", "prediction_short": "Human", "fraction_ai": 1.301223295779863e-10, "fraction_ai_assisted": 2.5189017219900443e-31, "fraction_human": 1.0, "version": "4.1", "source": "new", "dashboard_link": "https://www.pangram.com/history/65ac97c1-88c9-483a-bc30-2b8a427e3209", "utc": "2026-11-02T17:17:20Z", "windows": [["Human Written", "High", 39, 0, 225, "Instead, you might feel numb, cynical, angry, suddenly hungry, like you need to look at your phone, sexually aroused, like you need to make plans, sleepy, dissociated, or you might even think that what you're doing is stupid."], ["Human Written", "Medium", 4, 225, 249, " Those are not failures."], ["Human Written", "High", 73, 249, 635, " Often what you're experiencing is a very charming guard. It's what protects you when your consciously installed parental Protector isn't functioning, the same as when you were a child. It might not be a guard at all, though. Maybe it's your inner child, mad that you took so long to come back. Maybe it's your inherited parent script, or something from earlier today, or a bit of each."], ["Human Written", "Medium", 23, 635, 743, " So before you decide where it's coming from, ask it. What is it trying to stop? What does it want from you?"], ["Human Written", "High", 16, 743, 822, "\nTalk to the guard the way your Nurturer talks to your inner child: “I see you."], ["Human Written", "Medium", 19, 822, 912, " I'm not going to force my way past you. What's going on?” Then wait and listen patiently."], ["Human Written", "High", 34, 912, 1081, " If nothing comes back, that's okay, you don't need to push for an answer. Later on, you can ask it, “What are you afraid would happen if you stopped protecting me by…?”"]]}
{"name": "r1102b-D2", "sha256": "473684da3045d6f60b0cd5f357dd5649672c6c9910ac90a9348b3e3ab47a3ae2", "words": 151, "headline": "AI Detected", "prediction_short": "Mixed", "fraction_ai": 0.40229862928390503, "fraction_ai_assisted": 3.414635867012076e-33, "fraction_human": 0.597701370716095, "version": "4.1", "source": "new", "dashboard_link": "https://www.pangram.com/history/a68f6b1e-1ea6-4c31-b9a7-33ba058c8e2b", "utc": "2026-11-02T17:17:25Z", "windows": [["Human Written", "High", 41, 0, 207, "Pattern 10: Meta Model questions — the de-hypnosis tool\nTo 'Milton Model' is to open things up, so the listener can fill in what fits for them. To 'Meta Model' is to stop and ask, \"What do you mean by that?\""], ["Human Written", "Medium", 12, 207, 264, " In order to be ethical with people, you need to do both."], ["AI-Generated", "Low", 12, 264, 341, "\nWhen something sounds true but vague, ask, \"What do you mean, specifically?\""], ["AI-Generated", "Low", 10, 341, 395, " Then find out according to who, and compared to what."], ["AI-Generated", "Low", 28, 395, 549, " If you hear \"always\" or \"never,\" check whether it's really every time. If someone's afraid of doing something, ask what exactly would happen if they did."], ["AI-Generated", "Low", 12, 549, 615, " And ask how they know, and what evidence would change their mind."], ["Human Written", "High", 41, 615, 813, "\nSo when someone is starting to tense up in their body, use the Milton Model to help them soften. And when you feel you're losing track of what's really going on, that's the time for the Meta Model."]]}
